# Wanted (IDEAS I20 d, I20 e, I23, I25 c; QUESTIONS Q29, 6; board 0.7). Fails until it is answered; then it moves up.
# Story: as Arbor comes, no ring is drawn round the window in front, nothing stands in for a window that moves, and the menu bar has one icon.
open Safari
open Notes
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
focus 101
expect ring none
get focusRing
expect replied false
get menuBarControls
expect replied false
# The reply names the value that was: `animationDuration = 0 (was 0)`.
set animationDuration 0
expect replied was 0)
